--- !u!114 &466113732
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 466113726}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a4545a637c382a4fadd0fee9d507c0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  modelManager: {fileID: 627669789}
  pages:
  - header: Vitajte!
    content: "T\xE1to aplik\xE1cia v\xE1m umo\u017E\u0148uje presk\xFAma\u0165 tr\xE9ningov\xFD
      a simula\u010Dn\xFD model Learning Factory 4.0 24V od spolo\u010Dnosti Fischertechnik
      v prostred\xED zmie\u0161anej reality.   Pre ovl\xE1danie aplik\xE1cie vyu\u017E\xEDvajte
      Hand Menu a jeho prvky, pr\xEDpadne postupujte pod\u013Ea \u010Fal\u0161\xEDch
      pokynov na obrazovke. "
  - header: Learning Factory 4.0 24V
    content: "Vzdel\xE1vacie prostredie fischertechnik sa pou\u017E\xEDva na u\u010Denie
      a pochopenie aplik\xE1ci\xED v Industry 4.0 na odborn\xFDch \u0161kol\xE1ch
      a \u0161koleniach, ako aj na pou\u017Eitie vo v\xFDskume, v\xFDu\u010Dbe a
      v\xFDvoji na univerzit\xE1ch, v podnikoch a IT oddeleniach. Simul\xE1cia zobrazuje
      proces objedn\xE1vania, v\xFDrobn\xFD proces a proces dod\xE1vky v digitalizovan\xFDch
      a zosie\u0165ovan\xFDch procesn\xFDch krokoch."
  - header: "\u010Casti linky Learning Factory 4.0"
    content: '- Vakuum Gripper Robot                              - Delivery and
      Pickup Station                               - Sorting Line                                     
      - Multi Processing Unit                       - High-Bay Warehouse'
  - header: "Presk\xFAmajte jednotliv\xE9 \u010Dasti linky"
    content: "Teraz m\xF4\u017Eete interagova\u0165 s jednotliv\xFDmi \u010Das\u0165ami
